Dynamips for TeraLab
====================

This package contains the Dynamips Cisco router emulator built from upstream
source. Dynamips is licensed under the GNU General Public License version 2.

Upstream project: https://github.com/GNS3/dynamips
Source used:      https://github.com/GNS3/dynamips/archive/refs/tags/v0.2.23.tar.gz
Source checksum:  503bbb52c03f91900ea8dbe8bd0b804b76e2e28d0b7242624e0d3c52dda441a1

The complete corresponding source is the unmodified upstream tarball above.
TeraLab's build script is installed separately in the TeraLab source tree under
packaging/dynamips/build.sh.

Dynamips is a separate program. It is not linked into TeraLab, which is
licensed under AGPL-3.0-or-later, and it is not a combined work with TeraLab.

This package does not contain any Cisco IOS images. Users must supply their own
licensed IOS images.

On Debian GNU/Linux, the full GPLv2 text is also available at
/usr/share/common-licenses/GPL-2 and in this directory as GPL-2.0.txt.

